---
source: crates/leptoskit_cli/src/cloud/tests.rs
expression: help
---
Lists organizations you can see

Usage: list [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --url <URL>
          Cloud origin; overrides `LEPTOSKIT_CLOUD_URL` and [cloud].url

      --json
          Prints the documented JSON result

      --org <ORG>
          Organization slug; defaults to [cloud].organization or your personal one

      --project <PROJECT>
          Project slug; defaults to [cloud].project

  -h, --help
          Print help
